 "fixed": {
  "kinds": {
   "rule": "The shipped classifier (Vision signals and the feature print) labels each page's kind on the Mac and measures the collection's mix from a sample. A page whose top class is under 0.8 keeps the run's model. Mixed pages have no class: they go to the handwritten pick. Read handwriting on typed pages (signatures, dates, notes in the margin). Measured level on typed pages, not measured on mixed pages. Escalation is capped after 20 pages at 25% of the run's pages; never on a remote gateway, the Local Agent or Apple Vision as first reader.",
   "source": "kind-atrium.md §Verdict; K-kinds.md; kind-classifier.md; mixed-route-bands.md; 10-kinds-and-routing.md §3. The rule for the settings layer"
  },
  "placement": {
   "rule": "Print: Vision's line geometry with the reader's words aligned onto it, one run per line. Handwriting: kraken blla lines, CTC forced alignment, conf pick; a page under 0.67 confidence, or read by a reflowing reader, gets a text page. Text page only for RTL scripts, CJK and Thai, model-normalised readings and mark transcripts.",
   "source": "place-print.md §Verdict; place-hands-lines.md §Verdict; F-placement.md §6"
  },
  "enhancement": {
   "rule": "Nothing is applied before OCR by this stage; the OCR input is the reading copy's source image at the app's size cap. The reading copy and the OCR input are two named images; an OCR input is transient, never written, shown or used as a fallback reading copy. A content-removing method never replaces the stored page. Free: Vision checked by PP-LCNet, else leave and flag. Gateway: agree, else llmSingle. Charters and non-Latin scripts: llmSingle on every page where a cloud route exists. Deskew the reading copy after OCR when the median Vision line angle is 1 degree or more; nothing is cropped. No crop, dewarp or shading division on the reading copy, and none offered for viewing. Readers receive the 2,048 px long side at JPEG 0.85.",
   "source": "enh-ocr-input.md §Measurement card; enh-ocr-marks.md §Verdict; rotation-routes.md §Held out; place-geom-real5.md §Verdict; enh-dewarp.md §The app's encoding"
  },
  "layout": {
   "rule": "Newspapers and dense multi-column print: PP-DocLayoutV3 regions, the detector's own order, quad correction first on a photograph. Every other kind, and an uncertain kind, reads the whole page in the reader's line order. No detector on handwritten pages or registers. A page the detector fails reads whole.",
   "source": "layout-photo-tables.md §L9; layout-photo-tables.md §the 96; layout-photo-tables.md §handwritten"
  },
  "marks": {
   "rule": "No marks layer is offered; marks stay on the untouched reading copy. The reading copy and the OCR input stay the raw image; shading division is not offered for viewing.",
   "source": "marks-detect.md §What this says; enh-ocr-marks.md §Verdict"
  }
 }
}